Third-party material
--------------------
The word lists are curated study sets built against the Goethe-Institut's
official vocabulary lists — the Goethe-Zertifikat A1 "Start Deutsch 1"
Wortliste at
https://www.goethe.de/de/spr/kup/prf/prf/sd1/ue9.html
and the corresponding A2 list. Which words appear, and how they are grouped,
therefore follows a Goethe-Institut publication rather than this project.

That underlying list is the Goethe-Institut's, not the licensor's. This
repository cannot and does not grant CC BY-SA rights over it, and nothing
here grants commercial reuse of it. If you need the vocabulary set itself,
obtain it from the Goethe-Institut under their terms. The original
translations and example sentences in those files are covered by this license
as normal — only the selection is carved out.

